      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_05021762",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "general inspirational audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad, general audience seeking motivational or self-help content. The message 'live your life every moment' is a universal inspirational phrase, and the image of a smiling, dignified older man in formal attire is culturally associated with wisdom, achievement, and contentment. This visual metaphor appeals to individuals across demographics who are looking for encouragement to embrace life fully, make the most of each moment, and find fulfillment. The celebratory, posed nature of the image reinforces its use in uplifting contexts, making it suitable for anyone interested in personal growth, mindfulness, or positive affirmations.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
